{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のみさみさの服。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/11/17/111116_200819.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ママの服なんやけど\nもらったに〜(･∀･)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日メンバーから、可愛い！\nって言われたから\n載せてみたよ(*´u｀*)にひ\nまいやん\n撮ってくれてありがと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう、すっかり寒くなったよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少し冷たい風 空気に、なんだか\nちょっぴり淋しくなりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冬はXmas・お正月\n誕生日・バレンタイン\n色んな行事があって楽しいし\nファッションだって\n冬の服が1番好き。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冬の澄んだ空気、\n白い息に白い雪、\nキラキラ光るイルミネーション。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冬が近づくのは嬉しいけど\nなんだか寂しい気持ち。\nうん、矛盾。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな、風邪引かないようにね。\n気をつけて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はイベント！生声録音会。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待ってるよ(*^_^*)？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写メは、今日のレッスン。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/11/17/111117_010034.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなの様子を撮ろうと\nでも自分も写ろうかなーって\n迷ってたら、パシャ。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ必死になっちょん\nみさの顔。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい。"}],"source":"archive"}